  "prefLabel": "Rev 1501.19 Total net book value everywhere",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1501.19 \"Total net book value everywhere\" means the total original cost less depreciation and amortization, including tangible and intangible assets located inside and outside of New Hampshire. The term does not include non-railroad assets.\n\nSource. #10662, eff 8-27-14; ss by #13977, eff 5-23-24",
